          "homepage": "https://www.hallmarkchannel.com/pie-to-die-for-a-hannah-swensen-mystery",
          "overview": "When Hannah's customer and Delores' theater rival is murdered, Hannah must find her killer in order to save her mother's reputation. Chad and Hannah's romance blossoms.",
